    {
      "id": "section:2/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "Weight: shares vs weight",
      "source_hash": 11718954545503860063,
      "context_hash": 14339834222302988619,
      "translation": "Weight: shares와 weight 비교",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:48.480781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "v1 `cpu.shares` and v2 `cpu.weight` differ in scale but map to the same kernel concept:",
      "source_hash": 17069896440970227905,
      "context_hash": 4933352170849853031,
      "translation": "v1의 `cpu.shares`와 v2의 `cpu.weight`는 스케일이 다르지만 동일한 커널 개념에 대응됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:48.480782Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "v1 default: **1024 shares**",
      "source_hash": 10420354295968179687,
      "context_hash": 9767869841799691960,
      "translation": "v1 기본값: **1024 shares**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301444Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "v2 default: **100 weight** (range: 1–10000)",
      "source_hash": 4633665173370203243,
      "context_hash": 15676060040127996502,
      "translation": "v2 기본값: **100 weight** (범위: 1–10000)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301445Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:27/seg:0",
      "source": "Internally both set `task_group->shares` — the kernel always works in the v1 shares unit.",
      "source_hash": 8533607039312062717,
      "context_hash": 9321122298929105158,
      "translation": "내부적으로 둘 다 `task_group->shares`를 설정합니다. 커널은 항상 v1 shares 단위로 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301445Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:29/seg:0",
      "source": "Bandwidth: quota/period vs cpu.max",
      "source_hash": 17460240982932172928,
      "context_hash": 134706979689423327,
      "translation": "대역폭: quota/period와 cpu.max 비교",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301445Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:30/seg:0",
      "source": "v1 exposes quota and period as separate files; v2 combines them:",
      "source_hash": 8116341037729361814,
      "context_hash": 790895529156121915,
      "translation": "v1은 quota와 period를 별도 파일로 노출하지만, v2는 이를 하나로 합칩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301446Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel structures",
      "source_hash": 7841068922900714577,
      "context_hash": 2517082053337879442,
      "translation": "커널 구조체",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301446Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "struct task_group",
      "source_hash": 6419583383552350650,
      "context_hash": 16774779117040885463,
      "translation": "struct task_group",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301446Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Every cgroup maps to a `task_group` in the kernel:",
      "source_hash": 12047343309984543281,
      "context_hash": 11204736552691681041,
      "translation": "모든 cgroup은 커널 내부의 `task_group`에 대응합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301446Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Each CPU has its own `sched_entity` representing the group in that CPU's CFS runqueue.",
      "source_hash": 8763500822163640582,
      "context_hash": 6761943724300030677,
      "translation": "각 CPU는 해당 CPU의 CFS 런큐에서 그룹을 나타내는 자체 `sched_entity`를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CFS": "CFS",
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "runqueue": "런큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "This allows the group to be scheduled as a single unit relative to other groups and tasks on that CPU, then internally distribute time among its members.",
      "source_hash": 6712788260651158996,
      "context_hash": 86738915370893136,
      "translation": "이를 통해 그룹은 해당 CPU의 다른 그룹 및 태스크에 대해 하나의 단위로 스케줄링되고, 이후 내부적으로 구성원들에게 시간을 분배합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "struct cfs_bandwidth",
      "source_hash": 6974388610049277419,
      "context_hash": 13433844553623438210,
      "translation": "struct cfs_bandwidth",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "How bandwidth throttling works",
      "source_hash": 13479725403782918033,
      "context_hash": 6151176313055416583,
      "translation": "대역폭 스로틀링(throttling)의 동작 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "throttling": "스로틀링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Distribution to CPUs",
      "source_hash": 17089833484986902994,
      "context_hash": 11728790822537710286,
      "translation": "CPU로의 분배",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301447Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The global `cfs_b->runtime` budget is distributed to individual CPUs in slices:",
      "source_hash": 13888081604311257415,
      "context_hash": 6416941163739241074,
      "translation": "전역 `cfs_b->runtime` 예산은 슬라이스 단위로 개별 CPU에 분배됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301448Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "A CPU grabs a 5ms slice from the global pool.",
      "source_hash": 15471848318786192445,
      "context_hash": 10663279759764393552,
      "translation": "CPU는 전역 풀에서 5ms 슬라이스를 가져옵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "pool": "풀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301448Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "When the slice runs out, it requests another.",
      "source_hash": 2108410572911710450,
      "context_hash": 18097690884734494656,
      "translation": "슬라이스를 다 쓰면 또 다른 슬라이스를 요청합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301448Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "If the global pool is exhausted (quota used up for this period), the CPU is throttled.",
      "source_hash": 3642030723352261109,
      "context_hash": 6166548401041154650,
      "translation": "전역 풀이 소진되면(이번 period의 quota를 모두 사용하면) 해당 CPU는 스로틀링됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "pool": "풀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301448Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Viewing throttling stats",
      "source_hash": 771055952144149910,
      "context_hash": 18254451416453152159,
      "translation": "스로틀링 통계 확인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "throttling": "스로틀링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301448Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Group scheduling hierarchy",
      "source_hash": 14008194525746820989,
      "context_hash": 13475365178953631505,
      "translation": "그룹 스케줄링 계층 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301448Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "With `CONFIG_FAIR_GROUP_SCHED`, CFS builds a two-level hierarchy:",
      "source_hash": 13978854028929469601,
      "context_hash": 3313744273189174855,
      "translation": "`CONFIG_FAIR_GROUP_SCHED`를 사용하면 CFS는 2단계 계층 구조를 구성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CFS": "CFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301448Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Group A gets 2000/(2000+1000) = 67% of CPU.",
      "source_hash": 1696557069038189592,
      "context_hash": 3862155956869575461,
      "translation": "그룹 A는 CPU의 2000/(2000+1000) = 67%를 받습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Within A, task1 gets 2/3 and task2 gets 1/3 of A's share.",
      "source_hash": 7752389732107739337,
      "context_hash": 3091260588241086985,
      "translation": "A 내부에서 task1은 A 몫의 2/3를, task2는 1/3을 받습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "This nesting allows containers to have isolated CPU allocations while tasks within a container compete fairly among themselves.",
      "source_hash": 10007842714036089434,
      "context_hash": 2239109364061073572,
      "translation": "이러한 중첩 구조 덕분에 컨테이너는 격리된 CPU 할당을 가지면서도, 컨테이너 내부의 태스크들은 서로 공정하게 경쟁할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "v1 vs v2: key behavioral differences",
      "source_hash": 7628111995686710355,
      "context_hash": 5933942815706517086,
      "translation": "v1과 v2 비교: 주요 동작 차이",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Hierarchical bandwidth (v2 only)**: In v2, a child cgroup's effective quota is the minimum of its own quota and its ancestors' quotas.",
      "source_hash": 3389342683943542105,
      "context_hash": 12778482684922821219,
      "translation": "**계층적 대역폭(v2 전용)**: v2에서 자식 cgroup의 실효 quota는 자신의 quota와 조상들의 quota 중 최솟값입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "cgroup": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "In v1, cgroup bandwidth is per-cgroup, not inherited.",
      "source_hash": 7308805948431924208,
      "context_hash": 17696551265376870923,
      "translation": "v1에서 cgroup 대역폭은 cgroup별로 적용되며 상속되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "cgroup": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Unified controller (v2)**: v2 uses a single unified hierarchy — you can't mount cpu and cpuacct separately.",
      "source_hash": 10334129628018450110,
      "context_hash": 16366953788687079474,
      "translation": "**통합 컨트롤러(v2)**: v2는 단일 통합 계층 구조를 사용하므로 cpu와 cpuacct를 따로 마운트할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "controller": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Both are always enabled together.",
      "source_hash": 16107846822213889466,
      "context_hash": 17870524133264141313,
      "translation": "둘은 항상 함께 활성화됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Weight range**: v1 shares: 2–262144. v2 weight: 1–10000.",
      "source_hash": 3876145125708815142,
      "context_hash": 6465899660207721296,
      "translation": "**가중치 범위**: v1 shares: 2–262144. v2 weight: 1–10000.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The effective range is the same proportionally.",
      "source_hash": 3256250768405511728,
      "context_hash": 9161015956139778889,
      "translation": "실효 범위는 비율상으로 동일합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:56.301450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
